    "description": "Vintage Ball Mason Jars & Glass Insulators Set\nBrand\n: Ball\nColor\n: Blue, brown, clear\nDepartment\n: Tableware and Kitchenware\nProduct category\n: Tableware and Kitchenware\nType of item\n: Vintage Ball Mason jars w/ glass insulators\nStyle\n: Classic mason\nMaterial\n: Glass\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nAdditional details\n: 4 blue, 1 brown jar, 2 clear glass insulators\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nType\n: Vintage Ball Mason Jars W/ Glass Insulators\nDescription\n: Discover timeless charm for your home or kitchen with this classic set of vintage Ball Mason jars and glass insulators. This collection includes four blue Ball Perfect Mason jars, one brown Ball jar, and two clear glass insulators. Each jar displays the iconic Ball logo and showcases sturdy, quality glass craftsmanship, a signature of the trusted Ball brand. The blue and brown jars create a beautiful vintage color palette, while the clear insulators add unique collectible appeal, perfect for repurposing or display. These jars are ideal for rustic kitchen storage, displaying wildflowers, or enhancing farmhouse decor. The glass insulators can be used in creative upcycling projects or as conversation starters in your collection. All pieces are in good vintage condition with minimal wear typical for their age. Shop with confidence knowing you're acquiring authentic, eco-friendly vintage pieces that blend history, style, and practical value into one memorable set.\nClassic mason BALL Blue, brown, clear Glass Vintage Ball Mason Jars W/ Glass Insulators\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
